      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But it doesn't feel temporary. It feels like this is just who i am. Like i'm just built to be this person that people walk past without a second glance. It's exhausting pretending that things will change when it feels like the world just... doesn't have a space for me. It's almost like i'm just taking up air that someone else could actually use.",
